    <div class="faq-list__items" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">How much does an iPhone repair cost?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>Repair costs vary depending on your iPhone model and the type of repair needed. We offer some of the most competitive call-out prices in Kent, and there are no hidden fees. Contact us with your iPhone model and the issue, and we'll provide a free, no-obligation quote within minutes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">How long does a repair take?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>Most repairs - including screen replacements, battery swaps, and charging port fixes - are completed in under 30 minutes. We do everything on-site at your location, so you won't need to leave your phone with us or wait days for it to be returned.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">Which iPhone models do you repair?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>We repair all iPhone models from the iPhone 5 right through to the latest iPhone 16 range. This includes all Pro, Pro Max, Plus, SE, and standard models. If you're unsure whether we cover your model, just ask.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">Do you offer a warranty on repairs?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>Yes. All our repairs come with a warranty covering parts and workmanship. If you experience any issues with a repair we've carried out, get in touch and we'll put it right.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">How does your mobile repair service work?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>It's simple. Send us a message or give us a call with your iPhone model, the fault, and your location in Kent. We'll respond with a quote, and once confirmed, we'll arrange a convenient time to come to you. We carry out the repair at your home, workplace, or any convenient location - most jobs take under 30 minutes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">What areas do you cover?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>We cover the whole of Kent, including Ashford, Canterbury, Maidstone, Folkestone, Faversham, Dover, Tonbridge, Sittingbourne, Margate, Ramsgate, Whitstable, Herne Bay, Dartford, Gravesend, Sevenoaks, Chatham, Rochester, Gillingham, and all surrounding areas.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">Is there a call-out fee?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>No. There is no call-out fee for our mobile repair service. The price we quote is the price you pay - and if we can't fix the issue, you don't pay at all. That's our no fix, no fee guarantee.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">What payment methods do you accept?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>We accept cash and bank transfer. Payment is taken once the repair is complete and you're happy with the result.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">Do I need to back up my iPhone before a repair?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>We always recommend backing up your iPhone before any repair as a precaution. In most cases, your data will not be affected by a screen, battery, or charging port repair - but it's good practice to have a backup just in case.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">Can you repair water-damaged iPhones?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>Water damage can be complex and the outcome depends on the extent of the damage. We're happy to take a look and give you an honest assessment. If we can fix it, we will - and if we can't, you won't be charged.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">Can I watch the repair being done?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>Absolutely. We carry out all repairs at your location, so you're welcome to watch the entire process. Transparency is important to us, and we're happy to explain what we're doing at each stage.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <summary class="faq-item__question" itemprop="name">How do I book a repair?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>You can book a repair by using our <a href="/contact/">online quote form</a>, calling us on {{ site.phone }}, or sending us a message on <a href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a>. We'll get back to you with a quote and arrange a convenient time to come to you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

